e-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraEmpathetic",defaultMessage:"“Users have told us it's difficult to find archived projects during support and audits. Adding an archive filter will make this task faster and reduce frustration.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Empathetic is selected."},jiraCreative:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraCreative",defaultMessage:"“Instead of treating archived projects as hidden, let's make them discoverable on demand. An archive filter keeps the main experience clean while making historical work easy to access.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Creative is selected."},confluenceRovoDefault:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceRovoDefault",defaultMessage:"“This doc captures our current thinking and the decisions we need to make together. Please call out assumptions or gaps as you review.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Rovo default is selected."},confluenceWriteLikeMe:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceWriteLikeMe",defaultMessage:"Based on your previous content",description:"Temporary explanation shown beneath Confluence when the experimental Write like me style is selected."},confluenceProfessional:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceProfessional",defaultMessage:"“This document defines the requirements, scope, and success criteria for the feature. It serves as the source of truth for implementation.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Professional is selected."},confluenceEmpathetic:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceEmpathetic",defaultMessage:"“This proposal aims to solve a pain point we've consistently heard from custo