sages.jiraRovoDefault",defaultMessage:"“Let's add an archive filter so teams can find historical work without changing existing workflows.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Rovo default is selected."},jiraWriteLikeMe:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraWriteLikeMe",defaultMessage:"Based on your previous content",description:"Temporary explanation shown beneath Jira when the experimental Write like me style is selected."},jiraProfessional:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraProfessional",defaultMessage:"“Add an archive filter to the project list. The solution should preserve current filtering behavior and include test coverage for archived and active projects.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Professional is selected."},jiraEmpathetic:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraEmpathetic",defaultMessage:"“Users have told us it's difficult to find archived projects during support and audits. Adding an archive filter will make this task faster and reduce frustration.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Empathetic is selected."},jiraCreative:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.jiraCreative",defaultMessage:"“Instead of treating archived projects as hidden, let's make them discoverable on demand. An archive filter keeps the main experience clean while making historical work easy to access.”",description:"Example Jira work item description shown beneath the app name when Creative is selected."},confluenceRovoDefault:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceRovoDefault",defaultMessage:"“This doc captures our current thinking and the decisions we need to make together. Please call out assumptions or gaps as you review.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Rovo default is selected."},confluenceWriteLikeMe:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceWriteLikeMe",defaultMessage:"Based on your previous content",description:"Temporary explanation shown beneath Confluence when the experimental Write like me style is selected."},confluenceProfessional:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceProfessional",defaultMessage:"“This document defines the requirements, scope, and success criteria for the feature. It serves as the source of truth for implementation.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Professional is selected."},confluenceEmpathetic:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceEmpathetic",defaultMessage:"“This proposal aims to solve a pain point we've consistently heard from customers while keeping implementation practical for the team.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Empathetic is selected."},confluenceCreative:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.confluenceCreative",defaultMessage:"“Rather than starting with the solution, let's begin with the outcome we want users to experience. From there, we can explore several implementation approaches before choosing one.”",description:"Example Confluence requirements text shown beneath the app name when Creative is selected."},slackRovoDefault:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.slackRovoDefault.ai-non-final",defaultMessage:"“Hi team! We've reached the next milestone. Before we move forward, I'd love everyone's feedback on the remaining risks and open questions.”",description:"Example Slack message shown beneath the app name when Rovo default is selected."},slackWriteLikeMe:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.slackWriteLikeMe.ai-non-final",defaultMessage:"Based on your previous content",description:"Temporary explanation shown beneath Slack when the experimental Write like me style is selected."},slackProfessional:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.slackProfessional.ai-non-final",defaultMessage:"“Team, the migration has completed successfully. Please review the outstanding action items before tomorrow's deployment window.”",description:"Example Slack message shown beneath the app name when Professional is selected."},slackEmpathetic:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.slackEmpathetic.ai-non-final",defaultMessage:"“Thanks for everyone's work getting this over the finish line. I know the timeline was tight, and I appreciate the flexibility across the team.”",description:"Example Slack message shown beneath the app name when Empathetic is selected."},slackCreative:{id:"rovo-personalization.writing-style-tab.writingStyleExampleMessages.slackCreative.ai-non-final",defaultMessage:"“We've solved the immediate problem. Before we lock in the next step, are there any alternatives we haven't considered yet?”",description:"Example Slack message shown beneath the app name when Creative is selected."}}),K={jira:{rovoDefault:V.jiraRovoDefault,writeLikeMe:V.jiraWriteLikeMe,professional:V.jiraProfessional,empathetic:V.jiraEmpathetic,creative:V.jiraCreative},confluence:{rovoDefault:V.confluenceRovoDefault,writeLikeMe:V.confluenceWriteLikeMe,professional:V.confluenceProfessional,empathetic:V.confluenceEmpathetic,creative:V.confluenceCreative},slack:{rovoDefault:V.slackRovoDefault,writeLikeMe:V.slackWriteLikeMe,professional:V.slackProfessional,empathetic:V.slackEmpathetic,creative:V.slackCreative}},X=["isOpen"],$=[{id:"jira",name:"jiraName",icon:a.createElement(m.c,{size:"large"})},{id:"confluence",name:"confluenceName",icon:a.createElement(f.y,{size:"large"})},{id:"slack",name:"slackName",icon:a.createElement(z.k